origin of an unchanged release, but must identify itself as an unofficial mirror.
An official label is not a warranty or a substitute for verifying provenance.

No trademark rights are granted by this license. This includes rights in the
Nemoforge name, Junction Manager branding or logos, and the author's identity.
This statement does not claim that any name or mark is registered. Accurate
reference, attribution, and compatibility descriptions, such as "Fork based on
Junction Manager", are permitted to identify the source or relationship, without
implying endorsement, sponsorship, or official status. Such descriptions do not
authorize an otherwise prohibited distribution or branding use.

Retain the following notice, existing author and copyright attributions, and
the complete LICENSE in every copy and permitted distribution:

Copyright (c) 2026 Nemoforge (DINH DUC LOC)

Do not remove or obscure those notices. Clearly identify your own modifications
in any permitted shared modified copy. Technical quotations may provide source
attribution as appropriate under applicable law rather than reproduce the whole
LICENSE. No permission to use branding deceptively is granted.

